       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-FORMAL-REVIEW-PHASE4-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PHASE4-SECURITY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-ACID-ROLLBACK-ZERO-LOSS  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SIDE-CHANNEL-TIMING-IMM  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REBAR-SHADOW-GROUNDED    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-ENTROPY-MAINTAINED  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLEAN-ROOM-PURITY-MET    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PHASE4-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-SECURITY-SEAL-APPROVED   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PHASE4-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-TRANSACTION-SAFETY.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-SIDE-CHANNEL-IMMUNITY.
           PERFORM 3000-AUDIT-REBAR-RESTITUTION.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-PHASE4.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-TRANSACTION-SAFETY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ACID-ROLLBACK-ZERO-LOSS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-ENTROPY-MAINTAINED.
       2000-AUDIT-SIDE-CHANNEL-IMMUNITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SIDE-CHANNEL-TIMING-IMM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CLEAN-ROOM-PURITY-MET.
       3000-AUDIT-REBAR-RESTITUTION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REBAR-SHADOW-GROUNDED.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-PHASE4.
           IF WS-ACID-ROLLBACK-ZERO-LOSS = 1 AND
              WS-SIDE-CHANNEL-TIMING-IMM = 1 AND
              WS-REBAR-SHADOW-GROUNDED = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-ENTROPY-MAINTAINED = 1 AND
              WS-CLEAN-ROOM-PURITY-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SECURITY-SEAL-APPROVED
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PHASE4-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-SECURITY-SEAL-APPROVED
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PHASE4-CODE.
